            </note>
            <note corresp="#d20-f2" n="2" xml:id="d20-f2-content">
                <p>For text of treaty, signed in Moscow, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Documents and State Papers</hi>, July 1948, p. 235.</p>
            </note>
